ote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1418758-how-terrible-is-the-loss-of-white-wolf-forums?p=1430435#post1430435\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If your powers could in any way be construed as a shaping effect though? There's a 3m charm that lasts 24 hours and negates it. It's just kind of a weird mismatch where a foe that can level a hundred truck-busting punches at you in a second is deadly as fuck, but a blast of destabilizing radiation, or time shenanigans, or transmutation magic, or whatever is a joke.</div> </div> </div> </div>You do have to consider IPP in that it was written to be useful in a Charmset where you can go &quot;I spend 2m to use Seven Shadows Evasion, and a smile cockily as I Perfect Dodge the infinite damage attack, which is a level 1 stunt so I restore 2m.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>theoutlander523</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1418758-how-terrible-is-the-loss-of-white-wolf-forums?p=1431187#post1431187\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hell, I don't think you can even download the First Edition Errata anymore.</div> </div> </div> </div>Does anyone want that?<br /> <br /> Because I have it on zipdisk.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 01-13-2021, 05:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-13T17:14:08-08:00","id":1432145,"title":"","content":"I found a copy of the errata actually. Took a while, but it exists in the old archives.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VN49Y7tH2ZV0l7Hx65RWX1ez-Q9Lst-8ZTyTJeCTpxM/\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerer 20th</a> homebrew and my update to <a href=\"http://immortalthegathering.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Highlander: the Gathering</a> for 20th Anniversary edition.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2414-theoutlander523","name":"theoutlander523","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-18T19:52:44-08:00","id":1432649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1418758-how-terrible-is-the-loss-of-white-wolf-forums?p=1432116#post1432116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That\u2019s not what those links show though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, between the loss of the old forums and the terrible project managment of 3e core kickstarter... The slow release of supplements, please do tell me why the game is barely played anymore? Or rarely talked about on other rpg forums?<br /> <br /> I don't know if you were around back in the old days of 1e in 2003 or 04. The game was huge, groups were easy to find and the books widely sold in stores in my area. (Victoria, BC, at the time.) <br /> <br /> The size and level of activity on fan forums was nuts. The level of custom content was at least 10x, maybe 20x what we have now.<br /> <br /> The Exalted white wolf forums alone were 60% of the activity. The fan forums dwarfed what else was available (so far as I knew of at the time). Now it's all dead silicon and gone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2783,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","user":"Tytalus","date":". 01-18-2021, 10:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-19T00:53:28-08:00","id":1432659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tytalus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1418758-how-terrible-is-the-loss-of-white-wolf-forums?p=1432649#post1432649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, between the loss of the old forums and the terrible project managment of 3e core kickstarter... The slow release of supplements, please do tell me why the game is barely played anymore? Or rarely talked about on other rpg forums?</div> </div> </div> </div>Given your links show interest plummeting years before any of those things happened and staying fairly steady through all of them? Who knows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}